doctor witch~
The witch doctor~
An orcish witch doctor is here.~
This is the witch doctor offering services to you.  She is wearing the skins of several other races.  An ogres torso, and an elves skin as pants.  She is also wearing a necklace of TSARIAN teeth!
~
