#46104
King Cantris~
King Cantris~
Cantris, king of the orcs is here.~
King Cantris, the newly appointed king of the orcs is here, selling fine armor
to you to fight with the orc army with.  He is dressed in chainmail and gloves
of the finest metals. He even has a sword with the orc sign engraved upon it.
~
