#46105
battle orc~
A Battle Orc~
This orc is ready for battle!~
This orc, dressed in all his battle armor looks ready to fight for the kingdom
of the orcs! He has all his chainmail on, covered from head to tail, and has
his orc battlesword wielded.  Nice... Maybe you shouldn't mess with him until
you're like level 25.
~
