#46103
The Orcish Campgrounds~
You seem to be between two deerskin tents.  In front of you is a campfire that is roaring with flames.  North is what looks like a soldiers tent, plain and simple.  South, however looks like a bit more intricate tent, with beads hanging off of the top.  A sign on it symbolizes that it is a witch doctor's hut.  Orc army with a witch doctor? Hm.
~
