#46108
The Orcish Campgrounds~
To the east of you is the grand hut, probaly that of the command of the orcs.
In this section, however is a campfire that is still burning.  This one
differs in that it has been built with perfection, and all the ashes look like
they have been cleaned out regularly.  No more tents are north or south, but
uncleared forest lays there, almost too dense to see 10 feet into.  Back west
are the tents.
~
461 ROOM_NO_MOB SECT_FIELD
DDIR_WEST
~
~
