S

#46109
The commanders hut~
This hut has been built to extreme perfection, with a front entrance and back
one.  Beads, like that in the witch doctor's hut hang from the ceiling, and
everything in here is hand-crafted.  The chairs are made out of oak wood and
varnished to look shiny and almost too nice to sit on.  The walls are not
deerskin, but they are actual wood from tree trunks, that have been split in
two and nailed together.  The commander's chain is straight ahead of you...

~
461 0 SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_WEST
~
~
0 -1 46108
DDIR_EAST
~
~
0 -1 46110
S
#46110
A clearing~
The trees here are just stumps.  Obviously, these trees have been cut to make
tents and huts for more orcs.  All those years of growing, cut down for orc
wars.. hmm.  One stump seems to stick out from the others, however, because
it seems to be hollow. Interesting, eh?
~
461 ROOM_NO_CASTLE|ROOM_NO_MOB SECT_HILLS
DDIR_WEST
~
~
