#46112
The dense forest~
This very dense forest surrounds one hut, the hut of the commander of the orcs.
Trees reach up so high, you wonder how old they are... 40 million years? No..
must be 50 at least! Their bases measure at least 50 feet on some of the trees
and at times, it's hard to squeeze through the denseness of this place.
~
