#46118
Witch Doctor's Hut~
In here is fairly big, enough room to stand straight up.  There are potions brewing all around you, and jars with elf heads and ogre heads in them.  
Halfling eyes, Centaur hooves.. everything is found here.  The walls are made 
of some kind of skin, you presume deer skin since it's nothing fancy.  However
there are beads hanging from the ceiling of interesting shape and size.  A 
witch doctor is here, asking you if you need anything.
~
461 ROOM_SAFE|ROOM_NO_CASTLE|ROOM_INDOORS SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_NORTH
~
~
0 -1 46103
S
