#46128
A reigal looking hut~
This very reigal looking hut actually has a covered floor, and looks fairly
grand.  Gold everything surrounds you, that is, gold chairs, a gold bed, and
gold dishware.  The hut is still made of deerskin.  Only one bed inhabits this
hut, and that bed belongs to the king of the orcs, Cantris... King Cantris 
to you.
~
461 ROOM_SAFE|ROOM_NO_CASTLE|ROOM_INDOORS SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_SOUTH
~
~
