#46130
Outback the tent~
This is the outback of the tent.  North you see a spring quenching soldier orc's
thirst.  However each other direction is another story.  You see pitiful
soldiers laying on the ground moaning, and some even passed out.  Wouldn't the
commander be happy about this!?
~
