#46131
Center clearing~
This center clearing has a spring flowing through it, with orcs eagerly
drinking the water, trying to sober up from all the alcohol they have been
drinking.  All around you,  you see orcs that have passed out and probably
wouldn't even notice you.  Some of the more sober orcs have left back into
the tent.
~
